# What a graphify run writes but a checkout must not share (story 0061). Everything else in this folder is committed:
# graph.json, graph.html, GRAPH_REPORT.md, manifest.json and the community labels with their signature.

# The extraction cache and the dated copies of earlier builds: large, and rebuilt by the next run.
/cache/
/20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/

# Local state of one run: the interpreter path (it names this machine), the scan root, the incremental-build state,
# unconfirmed labels and the token tally.
/.graphify_python
/.graphify_root
/.graphify_build_state.json
/.graphify_labels.pending.json
/cost.json
